### Expected behavior

- Both `localhost:8080` & `https://manytools.org/http-html-text/http-request-headers/` but the trace only shows the header in `localhost:8080` should have `x-custom-header`

### Actual behavior

- Notice the `x-custom-header` is present in both `localhost:8080` & `https://manytools.org/http-html-text/http-request-headers/` but the trace only shows the header in `localhost:8080`
